{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……看到討厭的人了。」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0620", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼。好久不見了呢，蘭華小姐……不對，瀨名學園長。」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0138", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼久沒見，一來就是諷刺？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0621", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳想太多了，哪裡是諷刺。」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0139", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……像以前一樣叫蘭華就好了。至少我現在也是把妳當朋友的。」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0622", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，是那樣嗎？我還以為自己一定被蘭華小姐討厭了呢……」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0140", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛～我倒是被結子的女兒討厭了吧。」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0623", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽？怎麼會……」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0141", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳什麼都沒聽說嗎？我讓她遇到很多難過的事……」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0624", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為美羽是個不會對我吐苦水的孩子……」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0142", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟我女兒很像呢，那種個性。」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0625", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小愛理過得好嗎？」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0143", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她離家出走了。」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0626", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀哎呀……」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0144", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「孩子都漸漸長大了呢。」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0627", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是說啊……」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0145", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那妳呢？最近怎麼樣，過得好嗎？」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0628", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，託福。」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0146", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊。不要再像以前那樣逞強了喔。雖然不想說出口，但我們都不年輕了。」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0629", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蘭華小姐才是，要說年輕時的亂來的話……」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0147", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還說呢，結子妳不是也相當誇張嗎？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0630", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，現在想起來都變成美好回憶了。」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0148", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……就是說啊。」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0631", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0149", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，孩子總是和父母很像呢～美羽跟結子年輕時一模一樣。」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0632", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是那樣嗎？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0150", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒錯。傻得那麼正直、坦率，而且……」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0633", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有一雙澄澈到讓人忌妒的眼睛。」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0634", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蘭華小姐也是那樣喔。」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0151", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要這樣說啦～我才不是那種類型。」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0635", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……但我還是忘不了喔。那些跟蘭華小姐一起為了保護森林而奔走的日子。」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0152", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我只是被妳拖下水而已。」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0636", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我很感謝妳，蘭華小姐……」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0153", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那樣的我，現在卻是站在『這一邊』了呢。」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0637", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的不知道該說是諷刺還是……」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0638", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蘭華小姐這麼努力不是嗎？為了美羽和愛理她們……」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0154", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「即使如此，我還是希望自己是跟妳站在同一邊的人。」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0639", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0155", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀～吶～氣氛都變陰沉了。結子，下次來辦一個只有我們兩個人的同學會吧？我下個月有很多空檔時間。」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0640", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是呢。孩子們差不多也到了不再需要擔心的年紀了……」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0156", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……女兒都是這樣，有了男人之後心都往那邊去了。」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0641", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是從旁看著她們也是身為母親的幸福喔。」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0157", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是真心話？」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0642", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0158", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還是一樣這麼狡猾的笑容呢。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0643", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為孩子總有一天會離開父母……」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0159", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，也是啦。」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0644", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今後女兒們也請妳多照顧了。」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0160", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道啦。所以我才會到『這一邊』來啊。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0645", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0161", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，那些孩子們會注意到嗎……」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0646", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛，還不知道呢。」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0162", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳不告訴她嗎？」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "rk0647", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……或許沒有那個必要。」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "yk0163", "char_id": "結子"}]}
